# Reference files (internal docs)
Initial/
*.xml
# Carve-out: the `*.xml` rule above matches by name, so it also
# excludes `frontend/public/sitemap.xml` — the static multi-locale
# sitemap we serve at /sitemap.xml. PRs #34 → #37 tried multiple
# dynamic approaches (Next.js convention, dotted-folder route.ts,
# /api/sitemap + rewrites) — all failed on OpenNext-on-Cloudflare-
# Pages. Static file in /public/ is the bulletproof path. Update
# this file manually when adding a locale or public path.
!frontend/public/sitemap.xml
reference.txt
.claude/settings.local.json

# Playwright e2e artefacts — generated per-run, not source.
test-results/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/blob-report/
frontend/playwright/.cache/
test-results/
